OL,3,GNEWSAWinter coats and shoes donated to
OL,4,Akids in poverty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is preparing to send out
OL,7,Fthousands of items to children living
OL,8,Fin poverty ahead of winter.
OL,10,FYorkshire Children's Charity said it
OL,11,Fwould provide 40,000 essentials such as
OL,12,Fcoats, shoes and bedding free of
OL,13,Fcharge.
OL,15,FChief executive Charlotte Farrington
OL,16,Fsaid there were an estimated 2,500
OL,17,Fchildren in Yorkshire living in
OL,18,F"destitution", according to the Joseph
OL,19,FRowntree Foundation, and despite the
OL,20,Fhuge collection of items the donations
OL,21,Fwere "not even touching the surface".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
